        <mxCell id="UfGgkLNFZPZ-g_EJcgcq-1" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;trq90m&quot; data-start=&quot;227&quot; data-end=&quot;295&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;229&quot; data-end=&quot;295&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Scalability &amp;amp; Fault-Tolerant Architecture: E-Commerce Platform&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;297&quot; data-end=&quot;617&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;To support millions of users like &lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;Amazon&lt;/span&gt; or &lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;Flipkart&lt;/span&gt;, the platform must remain responsive during high-traffic events such as festive sales or limited-time offers. The architecture should prioritize &lt;span data-start=&quot;555&quot; data-end=&quot;616&quot;&gt;availability, elasticity, and fast recovery from failures&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;619&quot; data-end=&quot;622&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;el06fq&quot; data-start=&quot;624&quot; data-end=&quot;664&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;627&quot; data-end=&quot;664&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;1. Traffic Distribution Mechanism&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;666&quot; data-end=&quot;744&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Incoming requests are distributed efficiently using multiple balancing layers.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1ype69x&quot; data-start=&quot;746&quot; data-end=&quot;774&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;750&quot; data-end=&quot;774&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Edge Layer Balancing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;775&quot; data-end=&quot;821&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Handles external traffic at the network level.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;823&quot; data-end=&quot;947&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i8jtfm&quot; data-start=&quot;823&quot; data-end=&quot;889&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Uses services like &lt;span data-start=&quot;844&quot; data-end=&quot;873&quot;&gt;AWS Network Load Balancer&lt;/span&gt; or &lt;span data-start=&quot;877&quot; data-end=&quot;888&quot;&gt;HAProxy&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;31e1px&quot; data-start=&quot;890&quot; data-end=&quot;947&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Optimized for handling millions of TCP/UDP connections.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1admhv&quot; data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;982&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;982&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Application Layer Routing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;983&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Routes traffic based on request type.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1030&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Example:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1032&quot; data-end=&quot;1128&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sticky bg-token-border-light&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:c