Routing Policies&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1218&quot; data-end=&quot;1370&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13fa5fu&quot; data-start=&quot;1218&quot; data-end=&quot;1271&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1235&quot;&gt;Round Robin&lt;/span&gt; → evenly distribute normal traffic.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;icn5tw&quot; data-start=&quot;1272&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;1274&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;Least Response Time&lt;/span&gt; → route to fastest instance.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c4d9re&quot; data-start=&quot;1327&quot; data-end=&quot;1370&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;1329&quot; data-end=&quot;1340&quot;&gt;IP Hash&lt;/span&gt; → useful for sticky sessions.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1372&quot; data-end=&quot;1375&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;q7rvji&quot; data-start=&quot;1377&quot; data-end=&quot;1408&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;1380&quot; data-end=&quot;1408&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;2. Elastic Scaling Model&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1410&quot; data-end=&quot;1473&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;To adapt to changing demand, services should scale dynamically.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1q94n9x&quot; data-start=&quot;1475&quot; data-end=&quot;1510&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;1479&quot; data-end=&quot;1510&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Scale Up (Vertical Scaling)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1512&quot; data-end=&quot;1540&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Increase hardware resources:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1542&quot; data-end=&quot;1583&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rq10wz&quot; data-start=&quot;1542&quot; data-end=&quot;1552&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;More RAM&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kw9ugp&quot; data-start=&quot;1553&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Faster CPU&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ugw649&quot; data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1583&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Better SSD IOPS&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1585&quot;